# Ctrl+\ opens the focused block in a new pane, and Shift+Tab and Tab move the keys between the two panes, so x completes the block of the focused pane.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
	- Buy milk
END
keys <C-\>
see │  󰋜 › Errands
keys <S-Tab> j j x
see ✔ Buy milk
keys <Tab> x
quit
saved <<END
Errands:
	- Post office @done({today})
	- Buy milk @done({today})
END
